diff --git a/apps/desktop/README.md b/apps/desktop/README.md
index e0bb92c5b7..99327a8728 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/README.md
+++ b/apps/desktop/README.md
@@ -30,6 +30,16 @@ Desktop runs the Harness workspace in a native application. This reference cover
 
 ## Application overview
 
+The optional `DSH_DESKTOP_BRANDING` JSON overlay selects product identity, icons and an HTTPS update base. Without it, upstream identity and update behavior remain unchanged. Branded feeds retain rc.2's test release ID, nightly/latest channels and binary prefixes; unsigned packages have no update configuration. This product build embeds `vibe-finance-ui` and `stock-research-dsh`, their production dependencies and first-launch profile declarations. Set `DSH_DESKTOP_VIBE_SOURCE`, `DSH_DESKTOP_STOCK_SOURCE` and `DSH_DESKTOP_PRODUCT_SOURCE_MODE=worktree` to snapshot the approved product worktrees into disposable build directories. Ten rc.2 patches use the Desktop runtime patch installer; the published Web artifact is preserved and `check-inline-result.mjs` runs before sealing the runtime. `DSH_DESKTOP_ISOLATED=1` with absolute `DSH_HOME` and `DSH_DESKTOP_USER_DATA_DIR` isolates smoke-test storage, skips login-shell reads and avoids system protocol registration.
+
+The bundled finance plugin owns the initial work-details preference on Desktop as on Web: after Loader configuration is ready, it persists `ui-chat.transcriptView=compact` through Settings only when the user field is absent. Existing choices remain unchanged; the Desktop shell does not write a second preference layer.
+
+A non-upstream branding `appId` owns `~/.dsh-products/<appId>` as its Harness home, with Electron userData, session data and logs under `desktop-user-data/`. Ordinary launches set these paths before acquiring the single-instance lock; inherited or login-shell `DSH_HOME` cannot redirect the product into the official application. Official storage is not migrated or modified. Each launch adds missing built-in product bundles through the shared profile writer, preserving other manifest fields, bundles and user patches.
+
+The branded welcome window stays above other windows until the workspace opens. Vibe Finance presents one primary action, “Connect DeepSeek to get started”, followed by “Sign in with your DeepSeek account” as a secondary text link. The key page says “Paste your DeepSeek key”, uses “A key starting with sk-” as its placeholder, explains where to create a key at platform.deepseek.com, and retains “Set up later” and “Back”. Account operations and credential persistence remain upstream-owned; skipping opens the workspace for this launch only.
+
+Before product compilation, the build seals each source snapshot as a tar archive and a per-file SHA-256 manifest under `products/`, alongside its HEAD, working-tree diff and untracked-file hashes. Source worktrees remain read-only. The local-data bundle carries the current product configuration and version metadata; Backend supplies market, announcement and news queries.
+
 Desktop analytics follows the [product collection policy](../../packages/client/product-analytics/README.md), including its live application setting. Web usage is excluded. Update installation waits for its local analytics intake before locking API admission and stopping the Host. Intake has a one-second deadline; failure does not prevent installation, and collector delivery is not awaited.
 
 The desktop application is an Electron shell around the complete dsh Web application. An Electron RunAsNode child starts the shared profile runner, and Electron immediately loads the packaged Web entry at `dsh-app://app/`. Its shared loading page waits for Host boot injections, then starts the client without navigating to another document. Electron forwards application HTTP requests to the authenticated Web Host, dropping connection-level response headers (`transfer-encoding`, `connection`, `keep-alive`) that describe the Node fetch rather than the resource, and marking plugin bundle responses `no-store` because their per-launch revisions would only accumulate in Chromium's disk cache; WebSocket streams connect to that Host with credentials attached only for the owned application window. Node IPC carries boot injections, readiness, and shutdown. Desktop listens on an OS-assigned port by default, so it cannot collide with Web’s `3080` or a reserved port; a `webserver.config.port` patch can override it.
diff --git a/apps/desktop/README.zh.md b/apps/desktop/README.zh.md
index 430ac4ad3d..9a9e398e7b 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/README.zh.md
+++ b/apps/desktop/README.zh.md
@@ -30,6 +30,16 @@ Desktop 在原生应用中运行 Harness 工作区。本参考文档说明应用
 
 ## 应用概览
 
+可选的 `DSH_DESKTOP_BRANDING` JSON 配置指定产品身份、图标和 HTTPS 更新基址；缺省时保留上游身份与更新行为。品牌更新源保留 rc.2 的测试发布 ID、nightly/latest 频道及二进制路径，未签名包不带更新配置。本产品构建内置 `vibe-finance-ui`、`stock-research-dsh`、生产依赖与首次启动的 profile 声明。设置 `DSH_DESKTOP_VIBE_SOURCE`、`DSH_DESKTOP_STOCK_SOURCE` 和 `DSH_DESKTOP_PRODUCT_SOURCE_MODE=worktree`，将已验收的产品工作树快照到一次性构建目录。十个 rc.2 补丁经 Desktop 运行时补丁安装器应用，保留已发布的 Web 产物，并在封存运行时前执行 `check-inline-result.mjs`。设置 `DSH_DESKTOP_ISOLATED=1`、绝对路径的 `DSH_HOME` 与 `DSH_DESKTOP_USER_DATA_DIR`，可隔离冒烟存储、跳过登录 shell 读取及系统协议注册。
+
+Desktop 与 Web 的首次工作细节偏好均归内置 finance 插件：Loader 配置就绪后，仅在用户字段缺失时通过 Settings 持久化 `ui-chat.transcriptView=compact`。已有选择保持不变，Desktop 壳不另写一层偏好。
+
+非上游品牌的 `appId` 使用独立 Harness home `~/.dsh-products/<appId>`，Electron userData、会话缓存与日志归属其中的 `desktop-user-data/`。普通启动在获取单实例锁前设置这些路径；继承环境或登录 shell 的 `DSH_HOME` 不能将产品重定向到官方应用。官方存储不迁移、不修改。每次启动通过共享 profile 写入器补齐缺少的产品 bundles，保留其他清单字段、bundles 与用户 patch。
+
+品牌欢迎窗口在进入工作区前始终置顶。Vibe Finance 只显示一个主按钮“连接 DeepSeek 开始使用”，下方为次要文字链接“用 DeepSeek 账号登录”。密钥页标题为“粘贴你的 DeepSeek 密钥”，输入框提示“sk- 开头的一串字符”；保留去 platform.deepseek.com 创建密钥的说明、“稍后配置”和“返回”。账号操作和密钥持久化仍由上游负责；跳过配置仅对本次启动生效。
+
+产品编译前，构建将每个源码快照封存为 tar 归档及逐文件 SHA-256 清单，与 HEAD、工作树 diff、未跟踪文件哈希一同保存在 `products/`，来源工作树只读。本地数据 bundle 携带当前产品配置和版本元数据；行情、公告与新闻查询由 Backend 提供。
+
 桌面埋点遵循[产品采集策略](../../packages/client/product-analytics/README.zh.md)及其动态应用配置，不包含 Web 使用情况。安装更新会等待该操作的本地埋点接收请求结束，再锁定 API 准入并停止 Host。接收请求的时限为一秒，失败不会阻止安装，也不等待收集端完成发送。
 
 桌面应用是完整 dsh Web 应用外的一层 Electron 壳。Electron RunAsNode 子进程启动共享 profile runner，Electron 立即从 `dsh-app://app/` 加载打包内的 Web 入口。共享加载页等待 Host 启动注入，然后在同一文档中启动客户端。Electron 将应用 HTTP 请求转发给已认证的 Web Host，转发时丢弃描述 Node fetch 连接而非资源本身的响应头（`transfer-encoding`、`connection`、`keep-alive`），并把插件 bundle 响应标记为 `no-store`，因为其每次启动都变化的 revision 只会在 Chromium 磁盘缓存中累积；WebSocket 流连接到该 Host，仅为归属的应用窗口附加凭据。Node IPC 承载启动注入、就绪与关闭。Desktop 默认监听系统分配的端口，因此不会与 Web 的 `3080` 或系统保留端口冲突；可通过 `webserver.config.port` patch 覆盖。
